(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (WIRING TO THE WAVESHARE) Tj
T* (- Waveshare 16-pin terminal to carrier headers H8-H11, pin for pin.) Tj
T* (- DO NOT WIRE TERMINAL PINS 7 AND 8 \(CAN L / CAN H\). They couple noise onto I2C) Tj
T* (  and make the screen blink. Do not use H3's CAN pins with them connected either.) Tj
T* (- Waveshare VOUT \(terminal pin 3\) = 3.3 V. Measure H8-3. Never 5 V: it feeds the) Tj
T* (  I2C pull-up position and would over-drive the TUSB320 \(rated 3.6 V\).) Tj
T* (- Waveshare SW2 \(CAN / RS-485 120 R termination\) = OFF \(factory default\).) Tj
T* (- Keep jumper wires short and away from the boost converter \(L3/U9\).) Tj
T* (- Long I2C wires \(terminal 5/6\): twist each with a ground wire.) Tj
T* (- Waveshare USB-C to the ESP32 \(D+/D- on GPIO19/20\). Flash firmware through it.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (I2C BUS \(GPIO8 SDA / GPIO9 SCL, shared, 3.3 V\)) Tj
T* (  0x40 INA219 \(U5\)              0x41 TMR probe ADS122C04 \(A0 to DVDD\)) Tj
T* (  0x47 TUSB320L / 0x60 TUSB320  0x51 PCF85063 RTC \(Waveshare\)) Tj
T* (  0x5D GT911 touch \(Waveshare\)  0x20-0x27, 0x30-0x3F CH422G expander \(Waveshare\)) Tj
T* (- Terminal SDA/SCL go through a MOSFET level shifter, 4.7k to VOUT.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (DB9 \(DB1, FEMALE\) - NOT RS-232) Tj
T* (  1 RS-485 A          2 RS-485 B          3 NC) Tj
T* (  4 DO1 open drain    5 GND               6 DI0) Tj
T* (  7 DI1               8 DI COM            9 +12 V INPUT) Tj
T* (- RS-485: Waveshare auto-direction transceiver \(UART0, GPIO43/44\), Modbus RTU slave.) Tj
T* (  560 R failsafe bias. 120 R termination is DNP \(R28 + R30\).) Tj
T* (- DO1: open drain, 5-36 V, 450 mA. DI0/DI1: Waveshare optocoupled inputs.) Tj
T* (- I/O NOT ISOLATED: Waveshare I/O ground is tied to board GND at H11-2.) Tj
