(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (STATUS LEDS \(front light pipes\)) Tj
T* (- LED1 yellow \(NCD0603Y2\)  = external power present   -> LP1) Tj
T* (- LED3 green  \(KT-0603G\)   = rocker on, powered       -> LP3) Tj
T* (- LED4 red    \(KT-0603R\)   = charging                 -> LP2) Tj
T* (- LED2 green  \(KT-0603G\)   = charge complete          -> LP2) Tj
T* (- LP1-LP3: Bivar SLP3-150-100-F \(3 mm, flat lens, right-angle, press-fit\).) Tj
T* (  NOT IN THE BOM: order separately, fit by hand.) Tj
T* (- Check LED4 orientation against the cathode mark during assembly.) Tj
T* (- Faint LED1 with nothing plugged in = ESP32 D+ pull-up leaking through D7's VBUS) Tj
T* (  steering diode \(~1 mA\). Fixed in firmware \(pull-up only while a cable is attached\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (U8 USB-C CONTROLLER) Tj
T* (- BOM: TUSB320IRWBR \(C80170, I2C 0x60\).) Tj
T* (- Built REV-8 boards have a TUSB320L \(I2C 0x47\). Firmware accepts both.) Tj
T* (- Alternatives, same X2QFN-12 1.6x1.6 footprint:) Tj
T* (  TUSB320LAIRWBR \(C132554, newer, ~70 uA unattached\)) Tj
T* (  TUSB320LIRWBR  \(C2836598, ~100 uA unattached\)) Tj
T* (- Keep the BOM and the assembly order in agreement.) Tj
T* (- Default USB role is device \(PC\). Host \(flash drive\) only when U8 reports a drive.) Tj
