T* (DNP OPTIONS \("Add into BOM" = no\)) Tj
T* (- R4, R5    5.1k  C27834   CC1/CC2 to GND. ONLY if U8 is NOT fitted.) Tj
T* (                           Fitting them breaks flash-drive export.) Tj
T* (- R7        100k  C149504  5V_OUT to SRC_EN_N: holds TPS2041B off, no host mode.) Tj
T* (                           Device-only builds. NEVER WITH R6.) Tj
T* (- R20       0R    C17477   PWR_SW_G to GND: bypasses the rocker, always on.) Tj
T* (- R24, R25  10k   C17414   Extra I2C pull-ups to WS_VOUT. Long leads / slow edges.) Tj
T* (                           ONLY WITH VOUT = 3.3 V.) Tj
T* (- R27       0R    C17477   12V_IN to SENS_SEL: sensor powered from 12 V, not 5 V.) Tj
T* (                           NEVER WITH R26.) Tj
T* (- R28 + R30 0R + 120R      RS-485 termination, in series through TERM_B.) Tj
T* (                           Only if this unit is always at the physical end of the bus.) Tj
T* (- H1  GRPB051VWVN-RC \(C5447632, 1.27 mm\): sensor daughterboard.) Tj
T* (      UPDI, SDA, SCL, SENS_PWR, GND. Hand-fit.) Tj
T* (- H4  Power test:  12V_IN, 5V_DC, VBUS_EXT, VBUS_SINK, 5V_IN, BAT_NODE, SYS, SYS_SW) Tj
T* (- H5  Signal test: 5V_OUT, 3V3_AON, SDA, SCL, USB_ID, SENS_PWR, WS_VOUT, CHG_EN) Tj
T* (- REV-8 only: H7 UPDI \(program the sensor AVR\), H12 SENS_PWR test point,) Tj
T* (  H13 GND scope point.) Tj
T* (Fitted by default: H3 expansion \(SYS, 5V_OUT, 3V3_AON, SDA, SCL, CANH, CANL, GND\),) Tj
T* (  H8-H11 Waveshare terminal headers, R6, R26.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (ASSEMBLY) Tj
T* (- All SMD parts on the top side. Back is flat for the battery.) Tj
T* (- Hand-solder through-hole: DB9 \(DB1\), barrel jack, JST-PH battery \(U4\) and) Tj
T* (  rocker \(U7\) headers, light pipes, any optional headers.) Tj
T* (- Power traces: use pours for anything over ~300 mA, several vias per amp) Tj
T* (  at layer changes.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (BRING-UP CHECKS) Tj
T* (1. No battery, no Waveshare. 12 V on the barrel jack, supply limited to 200 mA.) Tj
T* (   Check 12V_IN, 5V_DC, 5V_IN on H4. LED1 lights.) Tj
T* (2. Fit a rocker \(or short U7\). Check SYS_SW on H4, 5V_OUT = 5.1 V on H5. LED3 lights.) Tj
T* (3. Bench supply 3.7 V / 1 A limit on U4 \(pin 1 = +\). Charge current flows, LED4 lights.) Tj
T* (4. Front USB-C to a PC: charges. Flash drive in: 5 V on VBUS.) Tj
T* (5. Connect the Waveshare \(no CAN L/H\), flash firmware, I2C scan:) Tj
T* (   0x40, 0x47 or 0x60, 0x51, 0x5D, CH422G \(plus 0x41 with the probe\).) Tj
T* (6. Rocker on, then off. Standby ~175 uA \(jumper method above\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (KNOWN ISSUES / NEXT REVISION) Tj
T* (- U8 part differs between BOM and built boards \(see above\).) Tj
T* (- DNP parts are not marked "DNP" on the schematic \(hidden BOM flag only\).) Tj
T* (- INA219 on the always-on rail: a battery reconnect leaves ~800 uA standby until) Tj
T* (  the next boot. Option: move it to the switched rail.) Tj
T* (- AP2112K \(~55 uA\) for 3V3_AON: a ~1 uA-Iq LDO would bring standby to ~50-100 uA.) Tj
T* (- D7 ESD array: choose one without a VBUS rail.) Tj
T* (- Q6 + D8 drop slows the end of charge from a PC port: consider an ideal diode.) Tj
T* (- No RTC backup cell on the Waveshare as built: the clock resets with power.) Tj
T* (================================================================================) Tj
ET
Q
endstream
endobj
